.github/
.claude/
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
docs/
backend.tests/
frontend/tests/

# Build artifacts & dependencies
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
